{"title":"2012 JBMO Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Section_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Section 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Section_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Section 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Section_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Section 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Section_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Section 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Section_1\">Section 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Section 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> be positive real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/6/0463a97b25dc0b519ce3c0a1ba6ff2ab6f9f518f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />. Prove that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60d96354dbf897c9576bd8f15779ad2e96d9fc8e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {a}{b} + \\frac {a}{c} + \\frac {c}{b} + \\frac {c}{a} + \\frac {b}{c} + \\frac {b}{a} + 6 \\geq 2\\sqrt{2}\\left (\\sqrt{\\frac{1-a}{a}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{1-b}{b}} + \\sqrt{\\frac{1-c}{c}}\\right ).\\]\" width=\"494\" height=\"53\" />\nWhen does equality hold?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Section_2\">Section 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Section 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the circles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f2f57887b2e2f63a617b6a4b7a7d466c26c4342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb72004e1c6c7b0782bbf2c7e40dcaad72993c4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> intersect at two points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be a common tangent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f2f57887b2e2f63a617b6a4b7a7d466c26c4342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb72004e1c6c7b0782bbf2c7e40dcaad72993c4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> that touches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f2f57887b2e2f63a617b6a4b7a7d466c26c4342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb72004e1c6c7b0782bbf2c7e40dcaad72993c4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> respectively. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/c/a4cf0099a42b1a1aeb8ad4376112eb0010e67b56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t\\perp AM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/d/89dc587e4e3f836b6da4ed9c018f8e7fc2fbe655.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN=2AM$\" width=\"102\" height=\"13\" />, evaluate the angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/c/ecc7ac23915d7a36f97e232b2f58ea522d593e55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$NMB$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\t\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Section_3\">Section 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Section 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On a board there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> nails, each two connected by a rope. Each rope is colored in one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> given distinct colors. For each three distinct colors, there exist three nails connected with ropes of these three colors.\na) Can <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />&#160;?\nb) Can <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Section_4\">Section 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Section 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/accc80fdf164cef264f56a82b6f9f6add320fe05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/667149e6157c29caad495246dab701c418a269c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^x3^y+5^z=7^t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO\" title=\"2012 JBMO\">2012 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"2011 JBMO Problems\">2011 JBMO Problems</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_JBMO_Problems\" title=\"2013 JBMO Problems\">2013 JBMO Problems</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 JBMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018055430\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 171/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 828/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 68/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4613/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.541      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%    6.541      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19773:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018055430 and revision id 252002. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}